---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Private Chef in the Algarve | Villa Dining | ByHenrique"
  description="Private chef in the Algarve for villa stays, family holidays, celebrations and retreats, with personalised Mediterranean menus and warm hospitality."
  alternateEn="/en/private-chef-algarve/"
  alternatePt="/chef-privado-algarve/"
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Private dining in Algarve</p>

        <h1>Private chef in Algarve</h1>

        <p class="lead">
          Personalised Mediterranean dining experiences for villas, holiday
          homes, family trips, celebrations and retreats across Algarve.
        </p>

        <p>
          ByHenrique brings a complete private dining experience to your table,
          with menus shaped around your guests, the occasion and any dietary
          preferences.
        </p>

        <p>
          Four Shores. One Table. The cooking brings together influences from
          Portugal, Greece, Jordan and Spain, combining Mediterranean flavours
          with warm hospitality, storytelling and an attentive but relaxed
          service.
        </p>

        <h2>A dining experience designed around your guests</h2>

        <p>
          Every booking begins with a conversation. You tell me the date,
          location, number of guests, occasion and the type of experience you
          have in mind. I then prepare a personalised proposal and confirm the
          practical details with you.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can begin with one of the
          <a href="/en/menus/">ByHenrique menus</a>
          or request a menu created specifically for your group.
        </p>

        <h2>Ideal for villa stays and special occasions</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Private dinners in villas and holiday homes</li>
          <li>Family holidays and group stays</li>
          <li>Birthdays, anniversaries and celebrations</li>
          <li>Couples and intimate dinners</li>
          <li>Retreats and small private events</li>
          <li>Personalised menus for dietary preferences</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Private chef service across Algarve</h2>

        <p>
          The service is available in locations across Algarve, including
          Faro, Tavira, Quinta do Lago, Vale do Lobo, Vilamoura, Albufeira,
          Portimão and Lagos.
        </p>

        <p>
          Availability and travel arrangements depend on the date, number of
          guests and exact location of the booking.
        </p>

        <h2>What you can expect</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Clear communication before the booking</li>
          <li>A menu adapted to your occasion and preferences</li>
          <li>Careful preparation and presentation</li>
          <li>Warm, attentive and engaging hospitality</li>
          <li>Respect for allergies and dietary requirements</li>
          <li>A clean and organised kitchen at the end of the experience</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          You can also
          <a href="/en/testimonials/">read reviews from previous guests</a>
          before making your enquiry.
        </p>

        <h2>How to request availability</h2>

        <ol>
          <li>Send your preferred date and Algarve location.</li>
          <li>Include the number of guests and the type of occasion.</li>
          <li>Describe any menu ideas, allergies or dietary preferences.</li>
          <li>Receive confirmation of availability and a personalised proposal.</li>
        </ol>

        <section
          class="booking-cta"
          aria-labelledby="algarve-booking-title"
        >
          <p class="eyebrow">Plan your experience</p>

          <h2 id="algarve-booking-title">
            Looking for a private chef in Algarve?
          </h2>

          <p>
            Send your date, location, number of guests and ideas to receive
            availability information and a personalised proposal.
          </p>

          <a class="booking-cta-link" href="/en/book/">
            Request availability
          </a>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>